= Members
The people in the Edge AI Lab

The lab is led by Assoc. Prof. Phuong Luu Vo. We supervise graduate and undergraduate students
jointly, so feel free to write to whoever works closest to your interests. See
[joining.html Prethesis and Thesis] for the projects on offer.

~~~
{Academic staff}{table}{faculty}
*Name* | *Position* | *Research area* | *Contact* ||
Phuong Luu Vo | Associate Professor (lab leader) | Distributed learning, deep reinforcement learning, wireless and mobile networking, IoT | [vtlphuong@hcmiu.edu.vn] ||
~~~

