# TEMPLATE -- one student is three lines. The "\n" at the end of a line forces a
# line break; "\M" prints the small separator dot. Copy this under the right
# heading, or use it to replace the placeholder box above.
#
# - *Full Name* \M PhD, since 2026.\n
#   Research: topic in one sentence.\n
#   Email: [name@example.edu]
#
# Undergraduate entries usually carry the project and its year instead:
#
# - *Full Name* \M Undergraduate thesis, 2026.\n
#   Research: topic in one sentence.
#
# Alumni entries say what they did and where they went:
#
# - *Full Name* \M Ph.D. 2026, now at Example Company. Thesis on distributed
#   resource allocation in dense networks.
#
# To add a member of staff, copy one row into the table at the top -- keep the
# DOUBLE pipes at the end of the row:
